      "path": "MBBSEmu/MBBSEmu-master/CLAUDE.md",
      "line": 7,
      "mechanic_id": "ITEM_EFFECTS",
      "bucket": "tests_validation",
      "text": "MBBSEmu is a cross-platform emulator for running legacy MajorBBS and Worldgroup modules (16-bit NE format DLLs) on modern systems. It emulates both the Galacticomm host environment and an x86-16 processor. Written in C# targeting .NET 10."
    },
    {
      "source": "MBBSEmu",
      "priority": 3,
      "path": "MBBSEmu/MBBSEmu-master/CLAUDE.md",
      "line": 54,
      "mechanic_id": "ITEM_EFFECTS",
      "bucket": "tests_validation",
      "text": "- **MBBSEmu/** - Main executable: emulation engine, host process, exported modules"
    },
    {
      "source": "MBBSEmu",
      "priority": 3,
      "path": "MBBSEmu/MBBSEmu-master/CLAUDE.md",
      "line": 63,
      "mechanic_id": "DATA_FIELDS",
      "bucket": "tests_validation",
      "text": "1. **Module Loading** (`Module/`): Parses NE-format DLLs, MDF (module definition), MSG (messages), MCV (config values). Each module gets a full 4GB virtual address space."
    },
    {
      "source": "MBBSEmu",
      "priority": 3,
      "path": "MBBSEmu/MBBSEmu-master/CLAUDE.md",
      "line": 65,
      "mechanic_id": "DATA_FIELDS",
      "bucket": "tests_validation",
      "text": "3. **Memory** (`Memory/`): `ProtectedModeMemoryCore` provides per-module 4GB address space. `FarPtr` represents segment:offset pointers. Memory is lazily allocated."
    },
    {
      "source": "MBBSEmu",
      "priority": 3,
      "path": "MBBSEmu/MBBSEmu-master/CLAUDE.md",
      "line": 66,
      "mechanic_id": "MAGIC_MANA_CAST",
      "bucket": "tests_validation",
      "text": "4. **Host Process** (`HostProcess/`): `MbbsHost` manages module lifecycle, session scheduling, and execution units. `ExecutionUnit` wraps CPU contexts for concurrent module operations."
    },
    {
      "source": "MBBSEmu",
      "priority": 3,
      "path": "MBBSEmu/MBBSEmu-master/CLAUDE.md",
      "line": 67,
      "mechanic_id": "ITEM_EFFECTS",
      "bucket": "tests_validation",
      "text": "5. **Exported Modules** (`HostProcess/ExportedModules/`): C# implementations of MajorBBS/Worldgroup APIs that modules call via imported ordinals. Each mapped to a virtual segment:"
    },
    {
      "source": "MBBSEmu",
      "priority": 3,
      "path": "MBBSEmu/MBBSEmu-master/CLAUDE.md",
      "line": 69,
      "mechanic_id": "MAGIC_MANA_CAST",
      "bucket": "tests_validation",
      "text": "6. **Sessions** (`Session/`): `SessionBase` subclasses handle different connection types (Telnet, Rlogin, local console). Sessions are assigned channel numbers and manage user I/O buffers."
    },
    {
      "source": "MBBSEmu",
      "priority": 3,
      "path": "MBBSEmu/MBBSEmu-master/CLAUDE.md",
      "line": 73,
      "mechanic_id": "ITEM_EFFECTS",
      "bucket": "tests_validation",
      "text": "- **Btrieve** (`Btrieve/`): Database engine emulation backed by SQLite. `BtrieveFileProcessor` handles CRUD operations with key-based access."
    },
    {
      "source": "MBBSEmu",
      "priority": 3,
      "path": "MBBSEmu/MBBSEmu-master/CLAUDE.md",
      "line": 76,
      "mechanic_id": "MAGIC_MANA_CAST",
      "bucket": "tests_validation",
      "text": "- **Logging** (`Logging/`): `LogFactory` manages `MessageLogger`, `AuditLogger`, `CPULogger` with pluggable targets."
    },
